# Visitor-uploaded review photos (local-disk fallback when Cloudinary is unset).
# Served by /api/review-photos/[name], not statically: a production build only
# serves the public/ files that existed at build time, so an upload written
# afterwards would 404. User content either way — it belongs in object storage.
.uploads/

